  "description": "After having her future as a bride sold off to a no-name gambler, Cecilia's life of lazy luxury has come to an end. Lost in the lament over not even being able to be with a man she loves, the daughter of the duke implores her butler, Liam, for advice. Liam, who realizes just how uninformed Cecilia is in what goes on in the bedroom, takes it upon himself to train his spoiled master.\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Noecheongsun Danpyeonseon (뇌청순 단편선) Collection.*",
